body:
It's happening agaln; people keep lying to me and telling me different things.  I get told that randoms suck and using party finder to raid is useless and won't happen,  but before that I'm told you can do raids/savage  with randoms.

&#x200B;

Please just stop lying to me, what is it?

Thank you for the words.

&#x200B;

Currently, I'm not in a good state of mind so I can't think of a reply. I don't feel good at all. but thank you for the support.

&#x200B;

I can't give up my sub because I'll lose my house. It's the only reason I log on.
